---
/**
 * Beauty's "what's inside". No ingredients are approved yet, so this stays a single honest,
 * non-itemized statement rather than an invented ingredient list — data-copy-review keeps it
 * flagged for approval before launch (same mechanism BodyFreshFaq.astro uses for pending copy).
 */
---

<section id="whats-inside" class="section-px section-py bg-beauty">
  <div class="container-lg grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr))] gap-[clamp(32px,5vw,72px)]">
    <div>
      <h2 class="display-word text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4.25rem)] leading-[0.88] stretch-display">What's inside</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[36ch] text-xl leading-normal" data-copy-review="Beauty formula not yet finalized">
        The Beauty formula is still being finalized. We'll publish the full ingredient list here once it's locked in.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-lg leading-[1.6] opacity-90" data-copy-review="Beauty serving size and format not yet finalized">
        Serving size, flavor and format will be confirmed alongside the final formula — the Supplement Facts panel will always
        be the definitive source.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
